Introduction
------------

We are pleased to invite the academic and business community to submit=
 their papers to the CISTI'2016 Workshops (11th Iberian Conference on =
Information Systems and Technologies), to be held in Gran Canaria, Can=
ary Islands, Spain, between the 15th and 18th of June 2016.

Authors are encouraged to submit original scientific contributions suc=
h as state-of-art reviews and new research perspectives, groundbreakin=
g ideas and/or architectures, solutions and/or applications for real p=
roblems, empirical and/or evaluation works, case studies, etc., in con=
formity with the themes and specific call-for paper of each Workshop (=
http://www.aisti.eu/cisti2016/index.php/es/xpto)

